{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>בעשר</b> — The proper form is <b>העשר</b> from the pi'el conjugation, and similar are: <b>לצבות בטן</b>, <b>לנחותם הדרך</b>. The meaning is at the taking of the tithe, and it is a tithe of the tithe."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:34.219904322Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}